WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Open Admin → Locations and choose Add location, or edit an existing row.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 2: Set its name, state and available settings, then Save settings.

3
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Step 3: Use the archive action for an inactive location when permitted.

4
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Step 4: Open the separate Archived locations menu to find or restore archived stores.
